<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Skills on timerring</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/tags/skills/</link><description>Recent content in Skills on timerring</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:22:54 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blogs.timerring.com/tags/skills/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>human-writing：让中文写作有点“活人感”</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/human-writing-chinese-writing-skill/</link><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:22:54 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/human-writing-chinese-writing-skill/</guid><description>&lt;p>让 AI 写中文，有时候会得到一篇很工整的文章。句子通顺，段落也齐全，就是读着有点累，像在看一份说明书。最近看到一个专门处理这类问题的 Skill，叫 &lt;a href="https://github.com/KKKKhazix/human-writing" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">&lt;code>human-writing&lt;/code>&lt;/a>&lt;sup>&lt;a href="#ref-link-1" class="footnote-ref" id="ref-link-back-1">[1]&lt;/a>&lt;/sup>，中文名是“活人感写作”。里面主要是 Markdown 写作规则，还有一个 Python 检查脚本。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>